    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 16, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "第二天，时间依然平静地流逝。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv02_Narrative001"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 18, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "到了放风时间，我正随意闲逛时，<br>\n蕾雅从正面朝我走来。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv02_Narrative002"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 20, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Leia.Smile1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 22, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "你好呀，希罗。", "AuthorId": "Leia", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv02_Leia001"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 24, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "蕾雅的气色明显比昨天好了许多。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv02_Narrative003"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 26, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "只是小小的余兴活动，<br>\n似乎就能让大家换换心情了。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv02_Narrative004"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 28, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Leia.Pensive1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 30, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "最近希罗的气势大不如前啊。<br>\n不过这也没办法……", "AuthorId": "Leia", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv02_Leia002"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 32, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Leia.Smile1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 34, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "但如果我真有个万一，<br>\n到时最值得依靠的，还是希罗啊。<br>\n毕竟我们是互相切磋共同精进至今的伙伴嘛。", "AuthorId": "Leia", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv02_Leia003"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 36, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（我可不记得和她互相切磋共同精进过……）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv02_Hiro001"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 38, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Leia.Smile1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 40, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "所以想拜托你一件事。<br>\n要不要和我一起去找典狱长？", "AuthorId": "Leia", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv02_Leia004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 42, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "找典狱长？为什么？", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv02_Hiro002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 44, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我想再去游说一次，让它取消魔女审判制度。", "AuthorId": "Leia", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv02_Leia005"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 46, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Leia.Angry1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 48, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "要是大家坚信凶杀案不会再发生，<br>\n那当然再好不过。", "AuthorId": "Leia", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv02_Leia006"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 50, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Leia.Pensive1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 52, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "可是一想到还有魔女审判这回事，<br>\n大家的精神就会遭到折磨。<br>\n我想尽自己所能，守护大家的心灵不受伤害。", "AuthorId": "Leia", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv02_Leia007"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 54, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "倒是能理解你的想法……", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv02_Hiro003"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 56, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 58, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（我也曾多次试图直接与典狱长交涉。<br>\n　但那只猫头鹰根本不听人说话）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv02_Hiro004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 60, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（恐怕只能无功而返吧……）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv02_Hiro005"]}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 62, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 63, "indent": 0, "params": {"Duration": 0.8999999761581421, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "SolidColor", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 64, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.2"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 66, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "话虽如此，<br>\n到底应该怎么办，我自己也毫无头绪。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv02_Narrative005"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 68, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "无论是对艾玛的憎恶与杀意——<br>\n还是如何对待其他少女们的方式——<br>\n乃至于在这座监牢中自己该扮演什么角色、该如何具体行动——", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv02_Narrative006"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 70, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "一切都在迷雾中徘徊，<br>\n看不到出口。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv02_Narrative007"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 72, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（这么软弱，真不像我……<br>\n　可是到底怎么做才【像我】？）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv02_Hiro006"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 74, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0, 50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Leia.Smile1,ArmR2"}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 75, "indent": 0, "params": {"Duration": 0.800000011920929, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "Transparent", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 76, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.9"}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 78, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "QuickSave", "line": 79, "indent": 0, "params": {"SlotNumber": 21, "Wait": 0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 81, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "希罗，<br>\n请你跟我一起去吧。", "AuthorId": "Leia", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv02_Leia008"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 83, "indent": 0, "params": {"Duration": 0.800000011920929, "Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0, 30.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Leia.Smile1,ArmR2"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 84, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.8"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 86, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "不知为何，<br>\n蕾雅突然单膝跪地，<br>\n郑重而优雅地向我伸出了手。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv02_Narrative008"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 88, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "那动作<br>\n宛如向公主求爱的王子一般。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv02_Narrative009"]}},
    {"op": "StopBgm", "line": 90, "indent": 0, "params": {"FadeOutDuration": 3.0}},
